{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoheading"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOHeading"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Text component used to structure the hierarchy of a screen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Four sizes are available; the largest ("},{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") can optionally display a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}]},{"type":"text","text":", i.e. a small brand-coloured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rectangle rendered below the text (when the current theme declares it supports one)."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOHeading","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Foundations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Sizes","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Sizes"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"XLarge","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The largest heading, useful for page titles."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The default heading. Only this size supports the marker and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colored substring"}]},{"text":" feature.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Medium","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A medium heading, typically used for section titles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Small"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The smallest heading, used for subsection titles."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Marker","level":2,"text":"Marker"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some themes (like ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BlueCoat"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") declare that a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"large","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" heading is decorated with a small","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"coloured rectangle below the text, i.e. the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Other themes may not use a marker at all but something else.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Coloring-a-substring","level":2,"text":"Coloring a substring"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated initializer accepts a "},{"code":"coloredText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sub-string instead of a marker."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This is useful to emphasize a specific word inside a heading (for example a brand name). This feature is only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"meaningful for ","type":"text"},{"code":"size == .large","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on other sizes a warning is logged and the text is rendered plain.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"warning","name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not all themes provide a valid ","type":"text"},{"code":"theme.colors.contentBrandSecondary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (some themes may mark","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the token as forbidden). When the token is forbidden the coloring is skipped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Simple raw string","    MISOHeading(text: \"Title\")","","    \/\/ Large heading with a marker (rendered only when the theme supports it)","    MISOHeading(text: \"Section title\", size: .large, hasMarker: true)","","    \/\/ Smaller heading (marker parameter would be ignored here)","    MISOHeading(text: \"Sub-section\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Heading with a brand-coloured word","    MISOHeading(text: \"Welcome to MISO\", coloredText: \"MISO\")","","    \/\/ Localizable from a bundle","    MISOHeading(LocalizedStringKey(\"section_title\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .large)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Accessibility","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component adds the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isHeader"},{"type":"text","text":" accessibility trait so that assistive technologies (like "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"VoiceOver","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announce the text as a header. When a marker is drawn, it is hidden from assistive technologies (decorative)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iO